{"access":"public","created_at":"2026-09-14T02:35:19Z","created_by_operation":"op_b0df29a02ee04e3e8d72225c104c0bbb","evidence_type":"organizational_statement","extraction_confidence":0.8,"id":"clm_1b7041bd0a7940d59fa5b8c68f46361f080cc1fcae8d3355da31370dd482790c","lineage_status":"original_available","polarity":"affirmed","record_type":"claim","review_state":"mechanically_checked","schema_version":"1.0","scope":{"instrument_status":null,"jurisdiction":null,"method":"documented","population":null,"qualifiers":"kind=observation; facet=limitations","setting":"rasbt/mini-coding-agent@717cae4ff10d snapshot c0f5070d67f9fc18","timeframe":null},"slice_ids":["slc_ef63616c26282aaa0583d766812ecfca00b0ea08c66fe791b2eceb3893b075b1"],"source_ids":["src_eef80e8cb408515aaf6803e560785838"],"text":"The README states the agent is intentionally small and optimized for readability, not robustness.","updated_at":"2026-09-14T02:35:19Z","updated_by_operation":"op_b0df29a02ee04e3e8d72225c104c0bbb"}
{"access":"public","created_at":"2026-09-14T02:35:19Z","created_by_operation":"op_b0df29a02ee04e3e8d72225c104c0bbb","evidence_type":"organizational_statement","extraction_confidence":0.8,"id":"clm_2a2f9d6bc7693821ac9e930ab64b3181a79d457dd459f6def35c2cfb8b41774f","lineage_status":"original_available","polarity":"affirmed","record_type":"claim","review_state":"mechanically_checked","schema_version":"1.0","scope":{"instrument_status":null,"jurisdiction":null,"method":"documented","population":null,"qualifiers":"kind=observation; facet=relevance","setting":"rasbt/mini-coding-agent@717cae4ff10d snapshot c0f5070d67f9fc18","timeframe":null},"slice_ids":["slc_0f50c59b1c81956e3223d4dafca4b014de8e34c1487359253f919f1acb3daa30","slc_48dffd8fc9620ae5b1737c73e3f0c45d176447afeb1ffa7e0d7e8f69ec7ccfc2"],"source_ids":["src_ef50206384cf59a3b9ee3253024795f3"],"text":"EXAMPLE.md provides a hands-on walkthrough of using the agent with Ollama on a small Python project: implementing, editing, and testing a binary_search.py file via the REPL.","updated_at":"2026-09-14T02:35:19Z","updated_by_operation":"op_b0df29a02ee04e3e8d72225c104c0bbb"}
{"access":"public","created_at":"2026-09-14T02:35:19Z","created_by_operation":"op_b0df29a02ee04e3e8d72225c104c0bbb","evidence_type":"organizational_statement","extraction_confidence":0.8,"id":"clm_326784a0ebc5d679e0629acafae72697ef90bb9550e90b5097077a953b1a60b6","lineage_status":"original_available","polarity":"affirmed","record_type":"claim","review_state":"mechanically_checked","schema_version":"1.0","scope":{"instrument_status":null,"jurisdiction":null,"method":"documented","population":null,"qualifiers":"kind=observation; facet=design-choices","setting":"rasbt/mini-coding-agent@717cae4ff10d snapshot c0f5070d67f9fc18","timeframe":null},"slice_ids":["slc_04f95138946fd5d212489bfef0e634241f7c175749aceb857dd3698f46610c48"],"source_ids":["src_eef80e8cb408515aaf6803e560785838"],"text":"Context reduction is documented: long outputs are clipped, repeated reads deduplicated, and older transcript entries compressed to keep prompt size under control.","updated_at":"2026-09-14T02:35:19Z","updated_by_operation":"op_b0df29a02ee04e3e8d72225c104c0bbb"}
{"access":"public","created_at":"2026-09-14T02:35:19Z","created_by_operation":"op_b0df29a02ee04e3e8d72225c104c0bbb","evidence_type":"organizational_statement","extraction_confidence":0.8,"id":"clm_4c2088faaef40bf75f5660a906751e8a79bc67897ed462f4d59e39e80d6e6eca","lineage_status":"original_available","polarity":"affirmed","record_type":"claim","review_state":"mechanically_checked","schema_version":"1.0","scope":{"instrument_status":null,"jurisdiction":null,"method":"documented","population":null,"qualifiers":"kind=observation; facet=interfaces","setting":"rasbt/mini-coding-agent@717cae4ff10d snapshot c0f5070d67f9fc18","timeframe":null},"slice_ids":["slc_5c46b179b83d14920a4fdca182fa16ed02a768810155e56ac8fcabaaacdf84b2","slc_cdeff114ec06c40f6d858198470ff67eacb65088c24694bd33c9b285d7c7be9d"],"source_ids":["src_eef80e8cb408515aaf6803e560785838"],"text":"The agent sends prompts to Ollama's /api/generate endpoint, with the default model qwen3.5:4b and default host http://127.0.0.1:11434.","updated_at":"2026-09-14T02:35:19Z","updated_by_operation":"op_b0df29a02ee04e3e8d72225c104c0bbb"}
{"access":"public","created_at":"2026-09-14T02:35:19Z","created_by_operation":"op_b0df29a02ee04e3e8d72225c104c0bbb","evidence_type":"organizational_statement","extraction_confidence":0.8,"id":"clm_56e4693320ae84c265b10c911d1fea45dab3afadae2b1d26c11105af32706c54","lineage_status":"original_available","polarity":"affirmed","record_type":"claim","review_state":"mechanically_checked","schema_version":"1.0","scope":{"instrument_status":null,"jurisdiction":null,"method":"documented","population":null,"qualifiers":"kind=observation; facet=design-choices","setting":"rasbt/mini-coding-agent@717cae4ff10d snapshot c0f5070d67f9fc18","timeframe":null},"slice_ids":["slc_ef63616c26282aaa0583d766812ecfca00b0ea08c66fe791b2eceb3893b075b1"],"source_ids":["src_eef80e8cb408515aaf6803e560785838"],"text":"The agent expects the model to emit either <tool>...</tool> or <final>...</final>, and notes that different Ollama models follow this format with varying reliability.","updated_at":"2026-09-14T02:35:19Z","updated_by_operation":"op_b0df29a02ee04e3e8d72225c104c0bbb"}
{"access":"public","created_at":"2026-09-14T02:35:19Z","created_by_operation":"op_b0df29a02ee04e3e8d72225c104c0bbb","evidence_type":"organizational_statement","extraction_confidence":0.8,"id":"clm_6663fa9faa9f4083a2224ae122fa963c4ea33a58b60b62e6b9bf853e89fa6f29","lineage_status":"original_available","polarity":"affirmed","record_type":"claim","review_state":"mechanically_checked","schema_version":"1.0","scope":{"instrument_status":null,"jurisdiction":null,"method":"documented","population":null,"qualifiers":"kind=observation; facet=design-choices","setting":"rasbt/mini-coding-agent@717cae4ff10d snapshot c0f5070d67f9fc18","timeframe":null},"slice_ids":["slc_04f95138946fd5d212489bfef0e634241f7c175749aceb857dd3698f46610c48"],"source_ids":["src_eef80e8cb408515aaf6803e560785838"],"text":"The design uses a stable prompt prefix separate from the changing request, transcript, and memory, so repeated model calls can reuse the static parts efficiently.","updated_at":"2026-09-14T02:35:19Z","updated_by_operation":"op_b0df29a02ee04e3e8d72225c104c0bbb"}
{"access":"public","created_at":"2026-09-14T02:35:19Z","created_by_operation":"op_b0df29a02ee04e3e8d72225c104c0bbb","evidence_type":"organizational_statement","extraction_confidence":0.8,"id":"clm_8670b85b9a413a33c74df2e862f51a78628b72bc029ed687d2cc897460a34c55","lineage_status":"original_available","polarity":"affirmed","record_type":"claim","review_state":"mechanically_checked","schema_version":"1.0","scope":{"instrument_status":null,"jurisdiction":null,"method":"documented","population":null,"qualifiers":"kind=observation; facet=dependencies","setting":"rasbt/mini-coding-agent@717cae4ff10d snapshot c0f5070d67f9fc18","timeframe":null},"slice_ids":["slc_a03cbc4d17b036193cd3dfa4849fcc48874571f1fb5dce2e5956d7190bcb75e8"],"source_ids":["src_eef80e8cb408515aaf6803e560785838"],"text":"The project reportedly has no Python runtime dependency beyond the standard library, so it can be run directly with python mini_coding_agent.py without uv.","updated_at":"2026-09-14T02:35:19Z","updated_by_operation":"op_b0df29a02ee04e3e8d72225c104c0bbb"}
{"access":"public","created_at":"2026-09-14T02:35:19Z","created_by_operation":"op_b0df29a02ee04e3e8d72225c104c0bbb","evidence_type":"organizational_statement","extraction_confidence":0.8,"id":"clm_a18453a4958068b4780700a050a1af38e63b4ab4e3f1cdbf40b878a80e4c67dd","lineage_status":"original_available","polarity":"affirmed","record_type":"claim","review_state":"mechanically_checked","schema_version":"1.0","scope":{"instrument_status":null,"jurisdiction":null,"method":"documented","population":null,"qualifiers":"kind=observation; facet=memory-state","setting":"rasbt/mini-coding-agent@717cae4ff10d snapshot c0f5070d67f9fc18","timeframe":null},"slice_ids":["slc_04f95138946fd5d212489bfef0e634241f7c175749aceb857dd3698f46610c48"],"source_ids":["src_eef80e8cb408515aaf6803e560785838"],"text":"The runtime reportedly keeps both a full durable transcript and a smaller working memory so sessions can be resumed while preserving important state.","updated_at":"2026-09-14T02:35:19Z","updated_by_operation":"op_b0df29a02ee04e3e8d72225c104c0bbb"}
{"access":"public","created_at":"2026-09-14T02:35:19Z","created_by_operation":"op_b0df29a02ee04e3e8d72225c104c0bbb","evidence_type":"organizational_statement","extraction_confidence":0.8,"id":"clm_a2cd2b595a3453f90509e0f6f6ba5cd1afbf788479db5441163416cfebcceba6","lineage_status":"original_available","polarity":"affirmed","record_type":"claim","review_state":"mechanically_checked","schema_version":"1.0","scope":{"instrument_status":null,"jurisdiction":null,"method":"documented","population":null,"qualifiers":"kind=observation; facet=tools-permissions","setting":"rasbt/mini-coding-agent@717cae4ff10d snapshot c0f5070d67f9fc18","timeframe":null},"slice_ids":["slc_383fdfa7e0b07d315c3b95b99bafa86ddad0d85b7988d5432c362e885e98d8a1","slc_57a783efb09d815493c61602803630b9b6fe83fece45fe1e93026234ad2c1201"],"source_ids":["src_eef80e8cb408515aaf6803e560785838"],"text":"Risky tools such as shell commands and file writes are gated by approval, with three modes: ask (default and recommended), auto (allows arbitrary command execution and file writes), and never (denies risky actions).","updated_at":"2026-09-14T02:35:19Z","updated_by_operation":"op_b0df29a02ee04e3e8d72225c104c0bbb"}
{"access":"public","created_at":"2026-09-14T02:35:19Z","created_by_operation":"op_b0df29a02ee04e3e8d72225c104c0bbb","evidence_type":"organizational_statement","extraction_confidence":0.8,"id":"clm_ae6278a5318e315b260f75f7ea905d23224d5f589fbba1672a6266ea5fb3b98c","lineage_status":"original_available","polarity":"affirmed","record_type":"claim","review_state":"mechanically_checked","schema_version":"1.0","scope":{"instrument_status":null,"jurisdiction":null,"method":"documented","population":null,"qualifiers":"kind=observation; facet=dependencies","setting":"rasbt/mini-coding-agent@717cae4ff10d snapshot c0f5070d67f9fc18","timeframe":null},"slice_ids":["slc_42d68e84becb2711d7be146781baee1c7dd0b872efbece04b36527b339567427","slc_b1d0de49d9fc09de77eb98b24bec08a614f89dcde85a4230b1936917d9a191f5"],"source_ids":["src_eef80e8cb408515aaf6803e560785838"],"text":"Running the agent requires Python 3.10+, an installed Ollama, and a locally pulled Ollama model; uv is optional for environment management and the CLI entry point.","updated_at":"2026-09-14T02:35:19Z","updated_by_operation":"op_b0df29a02ee04e3e8d72225c104c0bbb"}
{"access":"public","created_at":"2026-09-14T02:35:19Z","created_by_operation":"op_b0df29a02ee04e3e8d72225c104c0bbb","evidence_type":"organizational_statement","extraction_confidence":0.8,"id":"clm_d3eb1c49bb8514ef4d0cb75bd387c09b98d48f33fcf2d1d33889fbf2f52d0099","lineage_status":"original_available","polarity":"affirmed","record_type":"claim","review_state":"mechanically_checked","schema_version":"1.0","scope":{"instrument_status":null,"jurisdiction":null,"method":"documented","population":null,"qualifiers":"kind=observation; facet=orchestration","setting":"rasbt/mini-coding-agent@717cae4ff10d snapshot c0f5070d67f9fc18","timeframe":null},"slice_ids":["slc_04f95138946fd5d212489bfef0e634241f7c175749aceb857dd3698f46610c48"],"source_ids":["src_eef80e8cb408515aaf6803e560785838"],"text":"Scoped subtasks can be delegated to helper subagents that inherit enough context to help while operating within limits.","updated_at":"2026-09-14T02:35:19Z","updated_by_operation":"op_b0df29a02ee04e3e8d72225c104c0bbb"}
{"access":"public","created_at":"2026-09-14T02:35:19Z","created_by_operation":"op_b0df29a02ee04e3e8d72225c104c0bbb","evidence_type":"organizational_statement","extraction_confidence":0.8,"id":"clm_daca6bebab07369cdef9a988427dacb5a750e719e1e359a584e9afa6f16b087d","lineage_status":"original_available","polarity":"affirmed","record_type":"claim","review_state":"mechanically_checked","schema_version":"1.0","scope":{"instrument_status":null,"jurisdiction":null,"method":"documented","population":null,"qualifiers":"kind=observation; facet=memory-state","setting":"rasbt/mini-coding-agent@717cae4ff10d snapshot c0f5070d67f9fc18","timeframe":null},"slice_ids":["slc_0f8a82fc4c23844be53ded7bbca302ebf578af172916a51449f980033e2b990d","slc_4b37e9019b44d46a7b7922d7e2a0d39e155d445dd0636d49c6a43b66e0ab34bd","slc_8eecaaf8b0c44ab0d907d544cf92a633d32361b9ed5963026cb072c698843df9","slc_ec75daa8ab22aac054d1318d1dd922ba7c91be55b0368e85cc4a558c4572e32e"],"source_ids":["src_eef80e8cb408515aaf6803e560785838"],"text":"Sessions are saved under the target workspace root in .mini-coding-agent/sessions/, and can be resumed by id or with --resume latest.","updated_at":"2026-09-14T02:35:19Z","updated_by_operation":"op_b0df29a02ee04e3e8d72225c104c0bbb"}
{"access":"public","created_at":"2026-09-14T02:35:19Z","created_by_operation":"op_b0df29a02ee04e3e8d72225c104c0bbb","evidence_type":"organizational_statement","extraction_confidence":0.8,"id":"clm_ed2d7b9b91bca1964fdc43af4874d5202563401661bdbbeeedbc9efc632108bc","lineage_status":"original_available","polarity":"affirmed","record_type":"claim","review_state":"mechanically_checked","schema_version":"1.0","scope":{"instrument_status":null,"jurisdiction":null,"method":"documented","population":null,"qualifiers":"kind=observation; facet=interfaces","setting":"rasbt/mini-coding-agent@717cae4ff10d snapshot c0f5070d67f9fc18","timeframe":null},"slice_ids":["slc_0f276144348c35265bf25b01acba3fa3c79c4896eadf73c6909ee6d932ff4c0b","slc_d3373d9e5ac959aebd3d3182c345b004c9e3b3dbd76f846e6fe704815cfb014e"],"source_ids":["src_eef80e8cb408515aaf6803e560785838"],"text":"Inside the REPL, slash commands (/help, /memory, /session, /reset, /exit, /quit) are handled directly by the agent rather than sent to the model as tasks.","updated_at":"2026-09-14T02:35:19Z","updated_by_operation":"op_b0df29a02ee04e3e8d72225c104c0bbb"}
{"access":"public","created_at":"2026-09-14T02:35:19Z","created_by_operation":"op_b0df29a02ee04e3e8d72225c104c0bbb","evidence_type":"organizational_statement","extraction_confidence":0.8,"id":"clm_f6fa002234ccbc7896e84ed805b9a8df43f39d9e2f9221f311222400b26dcb2a","lineage_status":"original_available","polarity":"affirmed","record_type":"claim","review_state":"mechanically_checked","schema_version":"1.0","scope":{"instrument_status":null,"jurisdiction":null,"method":"documented","population":null,"qualifiers":"kind=observation; facet=interfaces","setting":"rasbt/mini-coding-agent@717cae4ff10d snapshot c0f5070d67f9fc18","timeframe":null},"slice_ids":["slc_5c46b179b83d14920a4fdca182fa16ed02a768810155e56ac8fcabaaacdf84b2"],"source_ids":["src_eef80e8cb408515aaf6803e560785838"],"text":"The agent exposes a CLI with flags including --cwd, --model, --host, --ollama-timeout, --resume, --approval, --max-steps, --max-new-tokens, --temperature, and --top-p, with documented defaults such as max-steps 6 and max-new-tokens 512.","updated_at":"2026-09-14T02:35:19Z","updated_by_operation":"op_b0df29a02ee04e3e8d72225c104c0bbb"}
{"access":"public","created_at":"2026-09-14T02:35:19Z","created_by_operation":"op_b0df29a02ee04e3e8d72225c104c0bbb","evidence_type":"organizational_statement","extraction_confidence":0.8,"id":"clm_f8ea165f584278848f9f35773a54b3472e225ec9744e83e901ba21db0ac05c52","lineage_status":"original_available","polarity":"affirmed","record_type":"claim","review_state":"mechanically_checked","schema_version":"1.0","scope":{"instrument_status":null,"jurisdiction":null,"method":"documented","population":null,"qualifiers":"kind=observation; facet=components","setting":"rasbt/mini-coding-agent@717cae4ff10d snapshot c0f5070d67f9fc18","timeframe":null},"slice_ids":["slc_0ce5866b84cace169142e89807d06a5e310987ea5bc7ab44b3a0f17fc276d342","slc_e4318473e2a08d5f575a31dcee949b1694310774559571f013dd970452806598"],"source_ids":["src_eef80e8cb408515aaf6803e560785838"],"text":"The agent is described as a minimal local agent loop with workspace snapshot collection, stable prompt plus turn state, structured tools, approval handling for risky tools, transcript/memory persistence, and bounded delegation.","updated_at":"2026-09-14T02:35:19Z","updated_by_operation":"op_b0df29a02ee04e3e8d72225c104c0bbb"}
